The six tools selected were:

WHOIS,WhatWeb,Nslookup,Curl,Wafw00f,DNSRecon

Tools Used:

WHOIS:

Collects domain registration and registrar information.







WhatWeb:

Fingerprints website technologies, CMS platforms, plugins, and server details.

Nslookup

Performs DNS queries to identify domain IP addresses and DNS records.

Curl

Communicates with web servers and retrieves HTTP response information.

Wafw00f

Identifies whether a website is protected by a Web Application Firewall.

DNSRecon

Performs DNS enumeration and collects domain infrastructure information.
